{{!
    @template responsetype_text/inlinesubmission

    The purpose of this template is to render the AJAX view of an activity's responses
    to show a user the different answers from other users.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * profile_picture - HTML for a given user's profile picture
    * profile_name - the name of the user whose response this is
    * viewing_own - boolean as to whether a user is viewing their own response
    * user_response - response text
    * user_response_time - the date/time the response was given

    Example context (json):
    {
        "profile_picture": "<img src=\"http://your.moodle.here/pluginfile.php/...\">',
        "viewing_own": true,
        "user_response": "It's sunny outside, I like it like that.",
        "profile_name": "Joe",
        "user_response_time": "01/10/17 13:28",
    }
}}
            <div class="user-profile">
                {{{profile_picture}}}
            </div>
            <div class="user-wrote">
                {{# viewing_own }}
                    {{# str }} youwrote, responsetype_text {{/ str }}
                {{/ viewing_own }}
                {{^ viewing_own }}
                    {{# str }} theywrote, responsetype_text, {{profile_name}} {{/ str }}
                {{/ viewing_own }}
            </div>
            <div class="user-answer">
                {{{user_response}}}
            </div>

            <div class="response-time">
                {{{user_response_time}}}
            </div>